ue:["Gemini 2.5 Pro","Veo 2"],wDa:!0,modules:[{type:"hero",content:{date:"May 16, 2025",headline:"Pioneering the next wave of filmmaking with the Gemini API",Ee:[{name:"Jamie Byrne, George Strompolos, Dave Clark",role:"Founders of Promise Studios"},{name:"Vishal Dharmadhikari",role:"AI DevRel"}],thumbnail:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/Promise_studios_hero.jpg",type:"image",alt:"Promise Studios showcase hero"}}},{type:"cta",content:{link:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-pro-latest"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"Pioneering the next wave of filmmaking with the Gemini API"},body:'<p>\n              The Gemini API, alongside groundbreaking generative video models like Veo 2, isn\u2019t just an incremental update to creative toolsets; it\u2019s the beginning of a new era in storytelling. <a href="http://www.promisestudios.com">Promise</a>, a visionary GenAI-native studio, is at the forefront of this transformation. By harnessing the collaborative power of Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview and the visual prowess of Veo 2, Promise is reimagining movie production workflows from script to screen, empowering their artists to explore uncharted cinematic territories.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Augmenting the cinematic creative process</h2>"},body:"<p>\n              Promise was founded on the belief that GenAI can help filmmakers bring ambitious stories to life. The studio is integrating AI deeply into the movie creation process, making workflows more agile, insightful, and visually dynamic than ever before.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              For Promise, Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview is amplifying human artistry, acting as a creative collaborator. It can help analyze human-authored scripts for deeper insights, aid in generating dynamic storyboards, and provide context for Veo 2 visual treatments, empowering artists to quickly iterate towards novel cinematic forms. Let\u2019s look at how Promise is prototyping these integrations:\n            </p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                <b>Deep script analysis:</b> Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview performs nuanced script analysis, identifying subtle themes, mapping character arcs, and suggesting visual storytelling enhancements.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Dynamic AI-assisted storyboarding:</b> Promise\u2019s directors upload hand-drawn character art and combine it with textual scene descriptions. Gemini 2.5 then rapidly creates dynamic storyboards.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Context-aware visual treatments:</b> Gemini 2.5 can provide rich context from script analysis to Veo. Veo is then prompted to generate video outputs (pre-visualization, VFX concepts, mood reels) aligned with the story\u2019s core.\n              </li>\n            </ul>"}},
{type:"youtube_video",content:{video:{JH:"_IZjHod7_Wc"}}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Unlocking creative velocity and cinematic expression</h2>"},body:"<p>\n              While development is ongoing, the integration of Gemini 2.5 and Veo into Promise\u2019s proprietary production workflow software, MUSE, shows strong potential to advance filmmaking:\n            </p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                <b>Accelerating creative ideation:</b> AI tools enable filmmakers to explore creative avenues faster.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Enhancing artistic control & iteration:</b> Quickly visualizing ideas allows artists to iterate and refine their vision.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Empowering leaner productions:</b> Using AI to handle laborious tasks frees up human talent to focus on the story.\n              </li>\n            </ul>"}},
{type:"quote",content:{quote:"At Promise, we\u2019re excited by tools that expand what\u2019s creatively possible. Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview and Veo 2 help our storytellers move faster from concept to creation. It\u2019s not about shortcuts or replacing filmmakers\u2014it\u2019s about helping them dream bigger and bring their stories to life.",author:"Jamie Byrne, President & Co Founder, Promise"}},{type:"text",content:{body:'<p>\n              Promise\u2019s pioneering integration of Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview and Veo 2 demonstrates the profound potential of AI to help reshape moviemaking and innovate what it means to be a studio in the Generative AI era. This collaboration heralds a future where storytellers are empowered with tools that can keep pace with their imagination.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              To learn more about building with the Gemini API, visit the <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs">Gemini API documentation</a> and get started in <a href="https://aistudio.google.com/">Google AI Studio</a>.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Promise is a participant in <a href="https://labs.google/aifuturesfund">Google\u2019s AI Futures Fund</a> that invests in and collaborates with ambitious startups building what\u2019s next in AI.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"related_cases",content:{tf:["vela","joltai","optimalai"]}}]},{title:"Spline",Xe:"Spline integrates Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview with its Hana editor, empowering users to generate entire interactive 2D and 3D experiences from simple text prompts.",slug:"spline",Ff:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-pro-latest",thumbnail:{url:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/Spline_thumbnail.jpg",alt:"Spline showcase preview"},ue:["Gemini 2.5 Pro"],modules:[{type:"hero",content:{date:"May 16, 2025",
headline:"Sculpting the Future of Interactive 3D with the Gemini API",Ee:[{name:"Alejandro Leon",role:"Spline Founder"},{name:"Vishal Dharmadhikari",role:"AI DevRel"}],thumbnail:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/Spline_hero.jpg",type:"image",alt:"Spline showcase hero"}}},{type:"cta",content:{link:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-pro-latest"}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Building the Future of Multi-dimensional Design with the Gemini API and Spline</h2>"},
body:"\n            <p>\n              The Gemini API is not just refining digital tools; it\u2019s fundamentally reshaping how we create and interact with digital worlds. Spline, the pioneering collaborative 3D design tool that brought real-time creation to the browser, is once again pushing boundaries. Spline is now integrating Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview capabilities with its new canvas editor, Hana, to empower users to effortlessly generate entire interactive 3D and 2D experiences directly from textual descriptions, fostering a new era of collaborative creation.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Simplifying Complex Interactive Design</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Building compelling, production-ready 2D and 3D interactive experiences traditionally involves complex, highly technical workflows that require specialised skills and significant time. Spline\u2019s goal is to radically simplify this process, making the creation of interactive content faster, more collaborative, and accessible to a far broader range of creators, directly within the browser.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Inside Spline: Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview Powers the New Hana Editor</h2>"},body:'\n            <p>\n              Spline\u2019s new Hana editor aims to streamline interactive content creation. As part of this, Spline is prototyping with Gemini 2.5 to introduce a groundbreaking text-to-experience capability. The goal is for the Hana editor, supercharged by Gemini 2.5, to transform how 2D/3D environments and interactive elements are generated:\n            </p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                <b>AI-Powered experience generation:</b> Prototyping focuses on enabling users to simply describe the elements, scene context, shaders, interactivity, and even game mechanics they envision \u2013 such as, "a retro arcade game where the player controls a spaceship to dodge asteroids, with a score counter."\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Generating interactive logic:</b> Gemini 2.5 is being explored to interpret these prompts and help generate the underlying interactive logic within Hana\u2019s engine. This will allow creators to rapidly prototype experiences using AI, which can then be collaboratively refined using Hana\u2019s familiar design tools to create production-ready content.\n              </li>\n            </ul>'}},
{type:"youtube_video",content:{video:{JH:"vPgaN5KHv1I"}}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Unlocking Creativity, Collaboration, and Accessibility</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              Spline anticipates that the integration of Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview into the Hana editor is poised to redefine the creation landscape in several significant ways:\n            </p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>\n                <b>Democratizing creation:</b> By allowing users to generate interactive 2D/3D scenes from text, the technical barrier-to-entry can be drastically lowered, making sophisticated interactive content creation accessible to more people, faster.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Accelerating prototyping & iteration:</b> The potential to reduce the time needed to create complex experiences from weeks down to minutes or hours would allow designers and developers to test concepts, iterate, and explore creatively at unprecedented speed.\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <b>Enhancing collaborative workflows:</b> By using Gemini 2.5 to handle the initial generation, teams can potentially jump immediately into a populated, interactive scene within Hana to collaborate on refinement, storytelling, and detailed interactivity, streamlining the production pipeline.\n              </li>\n            </ul>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Building the Future of Animation</h2>"},body:"\n            <p>\n              The Gemini API is not just refining digital tools; it\u2019s fundamentally reshaping how we create and interact with digital worlds. Spline, the pioneering collaborative 3D design tool that brought real-time creation to the browser, is once again pushing boundaries. Spline is now integrating Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview capabilities with its new canvas editor, Hana, to empower users to effortlessly generate entire interactive 3D and 2D experiences directly from textual descriptions, fostering a new era of collaborative creation.\n            </p>"}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Looking Ahead</h2>"},body:'\n            <p>\n              Spline is driven by the vision of making interactive 2D/3D creation easy and production-ready. The Hana editor, powered by Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview, is a monumental step in this direction.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              "At Spline, one of our main goals has been to empower designers by removing friction from the 3D design process. With Gemini 2.5 Pro Preview, we\u2019re not just simplifying workflows; we\u2019re giving birth to a new paradigm where the richness of your imagination can be translated into interactive 2D/3D experiences almost instantaneously," says Alejandro Leon, Founder of Spline. "The ability for Hana to take prompt descriptions and generate collaborative, interactive experiences is a game-changer. We\u2019re excited to see designers build entire interactive experiences, gamified content, immersive narratives, and beyond, faster and more collaboratively than ever before."\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Spline\u2019s pioneering prototyping work with Gemini 2.5 in the Hana editor illustrates the transformative potential of advanced AI to unlock sophisticated creative capabilities for everyone. This collaboration marks a significant leap towards a future where anyone can build the interactive, multi-dimensional experiences they dream of.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Ready to build? Explore the <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api">Gemini API documentation</a> and get started with <a href="https://aistudio.google.com/">Google AI Studio</a> today.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Spline is a participant in <a href="https://labs.google.aifulturesfund">Google\u2019s AI Futures Fund</a> that invests in and collaborates with ambitious startups building what\u2019s next in AI.\n            </p>\n            '}},
